Third-party components

This repository vendors the following third-party components, each under its
own license:

- MinHook (`native/third_party/minhook/`), including the bundled Hacker
  Disassembler Engine (HDE) 64 C — Copyright (c) 2009-2017 Tsuda Kageyu,
  BSD 2-Clause; see `native/third_party/minhook/LICENSE.txt` for full terms.
  Carries a local change so that functions compiled with AVX instructions can
  be hooked.
- Masked Software Occlusion Culling (`native/third_party/moc/`) — Copyright
  Intel Corporation, Apache License 2.0; see
  `native/third_party/moc/license.txt` for full terms.
- Vulkan-Headers (`native/third_party/vulkan/`) — Copyright The Khronos Group
  Inc., Apache-2.0 OR MIT (see the SPDX line at the top of each header).
  Unmodified.
